                  "text": "// AggregateConfig holds the configuration for an aggregate cluster.\ntype AggregateConfig struct {\n\t// LeafClusters contains a prioritized list of names of the leaf clusters\n\t// for the cluster.\n\tLeafClusters []string\n}",
